# HSR Wrapper workflow

When working in `directory/adopus-hsr-wrapper/`, always prefer the `asma hsr-wrapper` CLI over raw Python scripts. Read `.github/skills/hsr-wrapper/SKILL.md` for full reference.

Key points:

- `migrate` requires `--all` or `--only` (mandatory, no silent fleet-wide fan-out)
- `apply` is whole-engine only (no `--only` — subset payload drops omitted tenants)
- Metadata follows schema: never apply until all tenants converge on migrations
- `config.yaml` is in `.gitignore` — never commit secrets
- Slug changes require regenerate + apply (slug = namespace + type prefix + role + source name)
